<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>WallPrint India | Book wall printing</title>
<style>
:root{--ink:#172033;--muted:#657089;--blue:#2457d6;--pale:#eef3ff;--line:#e5e9f2;--green:#16845b}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:var(--ink);background:#f7f9fd}
header{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2}.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:0 22px}
nav{height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.brand{font-size:21px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.5px}.brand span{color:var(--blue)}nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:20px;font-weight:600}
.hero{padding:76px 0 60px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#eaf0ff,#fff 60%,#eaf8f2)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:36px;align-items:center}.eyebrow{color:var(--blue);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px}
h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,62px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-2px;margin:14px 0}.lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:610px}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:25px}
.btn{border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer;background:var(--blue);color:white;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block}.btn.secondary{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.hero-card,.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:24px;box-shadow:0 12px 35px #1720330a}.hero-card .big{font-size:46px;font-weight:850;color:var(--blue)}.pill{display:inline-block;background:var(--pale);color:var(--blue);padding:5px 10px;border-radius:99px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}
section{padding:56px 0}.section-head{max-width:650px;margin-bottom:25px}.section-head h2{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:5px 0}.muted{color:var(--muted)}
.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.feature{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px}.feature b{display:block;margin:8px 0}.icon{font-size:26px}
.forms{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.card h3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:22px}
label{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;margin:14px 0 6px}input,select,textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid #d8deea;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;font:inherit;background:#fff}textarea{min-height:82px;resize:vertical}.hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
.notice{border-left:4px solid #e2a02a;background:#fff8e8;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:8px;color:#614817;margin-top:18px}
footer{background:#111a2d;color:#d8deeb;padding:35px 0;margin-top:20px}footer .muted{color:#aeb8cc}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.step{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px;border-radius:14px}.num{color:var(--blue);font-weight:900;font-size:13px}
#msg{display:none;margin-top:14px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#e9f8f1;color:#126341}
@media(max-width:760px){.hero-grid,.forms{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}nav a{margin-left:8px;font-size:13px}.hero{padding:48px 0}}
</style></head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap"><nav><div class="brand">WALLPRINT <span>INDIA</span></div><div><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#book">Book</a><a href="#partner">Partner</a></div></nav></div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">India-wide wall printing network</div><h1>Turn empty walls into <span style="color:#2457d6">works of art.</span></h1><p class="lead">Find a wall-printing service near you. Customers can request a quote, and machine owners can apply to join the network.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#book">Request a quote</a><a class="btn secondary" href="#partner">Join as machine owner</a></div></div><div class="hero-card"><span class="pill">Marketplace concept</span><div class="big">25%</div><b>Proposed partner commission</b><p class="muted">Commission is a proposed business term and must be agreed in writing with each machine owner before accepting paid jobs.</p><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><b>Service coverage</b><p class="muted">India — partner availability will appear city by city after owners are verified.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Simple process</div><h2>How WallPrint India works</h2><p class="muted">A simple flow connecting customers with independent wall-printing machine owners.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="num">01</div><b>Customer requests</b><p class="muted">Share city, wall size, photos and preferred design.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="num">02</div><b>We match a partner</b><p class="muted">A verified machine owner in the service area receives the lead.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="num">03</div><b>Quote and schedule</b><p class="muted">Partner confirms feasibility, final price and visit date.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="num">04</div><b>Print and close</b><p class="muted">Customer approves the work; platform commission is settled.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section id="book" style="background:#f0f4fb"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">For customers</div><h2>Request a wall-printing quote</h2><p class="muted">Submit the details below. This demo form does not send or store your information yet.</p></div><div class="card"><form id="customerForm"><div class="forms"><div><label>Your name</label><input required placeholder="Full name"><label>Mobile number</label><input required inputmode="tel" pattern="[0-9+ -]{8,16}" placeholder="+91"><label>City and PIN code</label><input required placeholder="e.g. Bengaluru, 560001"></div><div><label>Wall size (approx.)</label><input placeholder="e.g. 10 ft × 8 ft"><label>Type of place</label><select><option>Home</option><option>Shop / showroom</option><option>Office</option><option>Restaurant / hotel</option><option>Other</option></select><label>What would you like printed?</label><textarea placeholder="Describe design, wall surface and preferred date"></textarea></div></div><button class="btn" type="submit" style="margin-top:18px">Preview request</button><div id="msg"></div><p class="hint">Do not upload private documents or pay anyone at this demo stage.</p></form></div></div></section>
<section id="partner"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">For machine owners</div><h2>Join the partner network</h2><p class="muted">Machine owners across India can express interest. Each application must be checked before appearing as an available partner.</p></div><div class="card"><form id="partnerForm"><div class="forms"><div><label>Owner / business name</label><input required placeholder="Name"><label>Mobile number</label><input required inputmode="tel" placeholder="+91"><label>Operating city and state</label><input required placeholder="e.g. Pune, Maharashtra"></div><div><label>Machine type / model</label><input required placeholder="Vertical digital wall printer model"><label>Service radius (km)</label><input type="number" min="1" placeholder="e.g. 50"><label>Portfolio / website (optional)</label><input type="url" placeholder="https://"></div></div><label><input type="checkbox" required style="width:auto"> I confirm I own or am authorised to operate this machine and agree to be contacted for verification.</label><button class="btn" type="submit" style="margin-top:18px">Preview partner application</button><p class="hint">No machine owners are connected yet. This is an application preview, not a live registration.</p></form></div><div class="notice"><b>Important:</b> The 25% commission, payment collection, refunds, damage responsibility, travel charges, warranty and customer complaints must be written into a partner agreement. Verify each owner, machine, service area and sample work before listing them.</div></div></section>
</main><footer><div class="wrap"><b>WALLPRINT INDIA</b><p class="muted">A proposed nationwide wall-printing marketplace. Partner coverage is subject to verification and onboarding.</p><p class="muted">Demo website • No live booking, payment, database or owner directory is connected.</p></div></footer>
<script>
function preview(formId,msgId,label){document.getElementById(formId).addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();const box=document.getElementById(msgId);box.style.display='block';box.textContent=label+' captured in this preview only. To receive real submissions, connect a secure backend, database and business contact channel.';});}
preview('customerForm','msg','Request details');
preview('partnerForm','partnerMsg','Partner application');
</script>
</body></html>
